{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Experience-Based Play.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Experience-Based Play.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"experience based play experience based play","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Experience-Based Play.md","fileName":"Experience-Based Play.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Experience-Based Play","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-21 00:27\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Play Styles and Structures]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Play Styles and Structures","gamesdesignandplay.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Experience-Based Play.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Experience-Based Play.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"experience based play experience based play","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Experience-Based Play.md","fileName":"Experience-Based Play.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Experience-Based Play","heading":"Experience-Based Play","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Experience-based play makes encountering a designed situation more important than winning or mastering a difficult action. Its value may come from exploration, the unfolding of a story, contemplation, or communal participation.\n\nRemoving a conventional victory condition does not remove design. The designer still structures attention, pacing, interpretation, and available movement so that players can discover the intended qualities of the experience.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Play Styles and Structures","gamesdesignandplay.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Experience-Based Play.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Experience-Based Play.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"experience based play experience based play","filePath":"6 -